:"source-question:b6d7ad4f82e7bf0b26dd61a51c747998166cd575bff1ad13c2ccdcdf947e6280","title":"How do three-form fluxes, nonperturbative superpotential terms, and non-BPS tension compete in the U,S,T sector of an isotropic IIB orientifold?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0043"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:b6c9fd3a8253566bbe0c4f629f2d3492fed35a4b4db75aad47526c2324e88da2","title":"Can inflating islands communicate when ordinary tunneling instantons do not connect them?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0045"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:b60bdb72c08ffc5ad3d28ff091ddc05bcc76edf0c54e64ea1e5dbb4277b5b7e3","title":"How do Hawking radiation and Schwinger production change charged black-hole mass and charge in de Sitter, and what EFT constraints follow if these configurations must return to empty de Sitter?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0046"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:b6c628f310dd90e187ad5bb386b662748cc6bbb7655d8010505779bce816b43c","title":"Can source-free type-IIA product backgrounds containing AdS2 exhibit parametrically separated compactification scales, and how do curvature bounds, Ricci-flat factors and flux quantization constrain that possibility?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0051"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:b60a39dbb9c2c1bd7c57b01109a0c774b6bb367899abc3692c882dd386432fe1","title":"How should bulk fermions coupled to a brane-localized Higgs be treated consistently without arbitrary regularization, and can compactification on star/rose graphs combine large volume, high KK scale and weak visible couplings?","connectionCount":1,"detail":{"shardId":"destination-details-fine-0052"},"indexTemplate":"source_question"},{"id":"source-question:b6637e45223ed40e8a0bce3cd90c0e929853484f179c3c822e36e9cc51460319","title":